WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.022
As technology keeps moving faster and faster,

00:00:03.022 --> 00:00:04.932
I am&nbsp;good with something slower.

00:00:04.932 --> 00:00:07.781
My finger beneath the words
 has led me to a life

00:00:07.781 --> 00:00:10.767
of writing books for&nbsp;
people of all ages,

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:14.317
books meant to be read 
slowly, to be savored.

00:00:14.317 --> 00:00:17.182
Sometimes we read to 
understand the&nbsp;future.

00:00:17.811 --> 00:00:20.544
Sometimes we read to 
understand the past.

00:00:20.544 --> 00:00:24.511
We read to get lost, to forget 
the hard times&nbsp;we're living in,

00:00:24.511 --> 00:00:27.727
and we read to remember 
those who came before us,

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:29.622
who lived through something&nbsp;harder,

00:00:29.622 --> 00:00:31.556
who were not allowed to read at all.

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:35.022
They, too, must have circled fires,

00:00:35.022 --> 00:00:38.378
speaking&nbsp;softly of their dreams,

00:00:38.378 --> 00:00:39.564
their hopes,

00:00:39.564 --> 00:00:40.916
their futures.

00:00:40.916 --> 00:00:45.018
Each time we read, 
write or&nbsp;tell a story,

00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:48.007
we step inside their circle,

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:51.366
and it remains unbroken.

00:00:52.101 --> 00:00:54.053
And&nbsp;the power of story

00:00:54.604 --> 00:00:56.295
lives on.

